#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_order_compute_commitment_date.field_product_product__attribute_extend_lead_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_order_compute_commitment_date.field_product_template__attribute_extend_lead_time
msgid ""
"If checked, the attribute lead time will be taken into account to calculate "
"the final lead time."
msgstr "Si está marcado, el tiempo de entrega del atributo se tendrá " 
"en cuenta para calcular el tiempo de entrega final."

